COMPND  10 OTHER_DETAILS: THIS PROTEIN IS A CHIMERA. RESIDUES 2-368 ARE FROM E. 
COMPND  11 COLI MALTOSE BINDING PROTEIN (MBP), CORRESPOND TO RESIDUES 27-393 OF 
